problem :
A - Double-Sided Printing  / 
Time Limit: 2 sec / Memory Limit: 1024 MiB
Score : 
100 points
Problem Statement
You are given a positive integer 
N.
You will print a document consisting of 
N pages on sheets of copy paper.
You will use double-sided printing, so one page can be printed on each of the front and back of a sheet.
Find the minimum number of sheets of copy paper needed to print all 
N pages.
Constraints
1≤N≤100
N is an integer.
Input
The input is given from Standard Input in the following format:
N
Output
Print the answer.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
solution code :--
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#include<iostream>
using namespace std;

int main(){
    int n;
    cin >> n;
    if(n%2==0){
        cout << (n/2) ;
    }
    else
    cout << (n/2)+1;

    return 0;
}
